From 5d00971e06f3e2fdfac57ef6cc82b2890206f24a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Usty <usty@uase.tech>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 18:58:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: add missing location purpose strings - resolves the
 ITMS-90683 warnings from build 74

Build 74 uploaded successfully (this was just a warning, not a
rejection), but worth fixing before submitting for review - Apple's
human reviewers can reject an app later for a missing purpose string
even when the automated upload check only warned.

Added NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription and
NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription to Info.plist, matching
the existing pattern and voice used for the camera/photo library/
microphone descriptions already there.

Worth knowing: checked the app's own code and it never actually calls
the Geolocation plugin anywhere - @capacitor/geolocation is installed
but unused, which is exactly why this warning appeared (the plugin's
native code is bundled into the app regardless of whether the JS side
ever calls it). Removing the unused dependency entirely would be a
cleaner fix, but that's a more invasive change (package.json + native
project regeneration) - fine as a future cleanup, not urgent, and the
purpose strings alone fully resolve what Apple actually flagged.
---
 ios/App/App/Info.plist | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ios/App/App/Info.plist b/ios/App/App/Info.plist
index 4ebd439..2bb4d37 100644
--- a/ios/App/App/Info.plist
+++ b/ios/App/App/Info.plist
@@ -55,6 +55,10 @@
 	<string>CARSTRIMS uses speech recognition so you can search for cars by speaking instead of typing.</string>
 	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
 	<string>CARSTRIMS needs microphone access for voice search.</string>
+	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
+	<string>CARSTRIMS uses your location to show nearby dealers and vehicles, and to fill in your state and city when setting up your dealership or listing a vehicle.</string>
+	<key>NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
+	<string>CARSTRIMS uses your location to show nearby dealers and vehicles, and to fill in your state and city when setting up your dealership or listing a vehicle.</string>
 	<key>UIViewControllerBasedStatusBarAppearance</key>
 	<true/>
 </dict>
-- 
